WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.500
Another orbit on a lonely road

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.500
Just trying to send a signal back to you

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.200
Carrying the weight of this heavy load

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:01.000
Charting the course that is pulling us through

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.500
The lights are bright, the station is cold

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.000
They tried to lock us in their terrestrial mold

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:14.000
I see your beacon across the endless black

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.000
I know our gravity will bring us back

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:26.000
We're worlds apart, but our hearts beat the same!

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:33.500
Across the starfield I can hear you call my name!

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:39.200
Through the distance, through the static and the dark

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:44.500
We're locked in orbit right back where we start!

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:51.000
Even when we're worlds apart!

00:01:51.500 --> 00:02:00.000
[Guitar Solo]

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:03.200
They wanted the glitter, they wanted the show

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:06.200
A hollow reflection of the people we know

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:09.500
But we built a sanctuary out in the deep

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:14.000
A sibling promise that we always keep!

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:21.500
We're worlds apart, but our hearts beat the same!

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.000
Across the starfield I can hear you call my name!

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Through the distance, through the static and the dark

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:39.200
We're locked in orbit right back where we start!

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:46.500
Even when we're worlds apart!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:56.500
[Instrumental Break]

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.000
And when the satellites fall

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:03.000
And when the nebulae rise

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:07.500
I'll find your signal

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:11.500
In the velvet skies!

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:20.000
We're worlds apart, but our hearts beat the same!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:26.000
Across the starfield I can hear you call my name!

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.000
Through the distance, through the static and the dark

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:37.200
We're locked in orbit right back where we start!

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:45.000
Even when we're worlds apart!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.000
Worlds apart...

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:51.800
Locked in the same orbit...

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:56.000
Coming home to you...

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:57.000
[Outro]
